  "title": "Bitter Chocolate, Lavender, and Banana Tea Loaf",
  "description": "The unexpected flavor combination of bitter chocolate, lavender flowers, and orange zest gives banana bread a sophisticated taste that goes perfect with a cup of your favorite tea.",
  "authors": [
    "Lynn A Jaskowiak"
  ],
